OL,3,GNEWSALandfill company faces HMRC
OL,4,Awinding-up petition
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe operator of a landfill site blamed
OL,7,Fby villagers for creating a
OL,8,F"horrendous" smelling mountain of
OL,9,Frubbish is facing potential closure
OL,10,Fafter an application by HMRC.
OL,12,FSeletia (HW) Limited, which runs Hespin
OL,13,FWood Landfill near Carlisle, is facing
OL,14,Fa winding-up petition, which creditors
OL,15,Fcan file when trying to recover debts.
OL,17,FThe Insolvency and Companies List said
OL,18,Fa hearing for the case was scheduled
OL,19,Ffor 9 December at the Rolls Building in
OL,20,FLondon.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
